Update:

Sadeq's suggestion could be mimicked very inexpensively by the pgf/tikZ package.

\documentclass[11pt,a4paper]{article}
\usepackage[T1]{fontenc}
\usepackage[utf8]{inputenc}
\usepackage{tikz}
